  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, saute the chopped onion and minced garlic in a little bit of oil until softened.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes to the pot and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the thawed frozen peas, vegetable broth, tomato paste, dried thyme, salt, and pepper to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat and let simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the stew to the desired consistency.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
